ss, and unforgettable. With state-of-the-art sound and vision, our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab & Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 row d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n          <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">Discover</h6>\n          <ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/select-your-cinema\" class=\"p-0\">Box Office</a></p></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/blogs/events\" class=\"p-0\">Events</a></p></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/private-hire\" class=\"p-0\">Private Hire</a></p></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/membership\" class=\"p-0\">Membership</a></p></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/recording-studio\" class=\"p-0\">Recording Studio</a></p></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/dine-and-drink\" class=\"p-0\">Dine & Drink</a></p></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/account\" class=\"p-0\">Sign In</a></p></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n          <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">About</h6>\n          <ul class=\"nav flex-column\"