n              <span class=\"tagline\">Sign Up</span>\n          </a>\n      </div> --></div>    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"section_1_stack\" class=\"bg-dark py-4 py-lg-5\">    <div class=\"d-lg-block text-center \">\n        <img class=\"w-auto logo3-whatson mt-0\" src=\"/assets/images/cinema-logo-white-3.png\" alt=\"Cinema Logo\">\n    </div></section><section id=\"section_2_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0\"><section class=\"mb-0\">\n    <div class=\"page-header py-5 py-md-0 ratio ratio-2x1 position-relative bg-white\">\n        <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2003_7_1.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 991.9px)\">\n            <source srcset=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2003_10_1.jpg\" media=\"(min-width: 992px)\">\n            <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2003_10_1.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" class=\"w-100 h-100 position-absolute top-0 start-0 object-fit-cover\">\n        </picture>\n<div class=\"position-absolute w-100 w-lg-50 h-50 h-lg-100 bg-grad\"></div>        <div id=\"movie-overlay\" class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-end justify-content-lg-center align-items-center align-items-lg-start h-100 mx-lg-7\">\n        <div class=\"d-none d-lg-inline movie-awards mb-4 d-flex justify-content-start\"></div>    <img class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-lg-6\" src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2003_8_1.png\" alt=\"Logo\">    <div class=\"movie-badges mb-2 d-flex justify-content-start\">        <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2\">2024</span>\n    <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2\">2hr 2mins</span>        <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageMisc/Dolby/Atmos/Vertical/DLB_Atms_vert_rgb_wht_@1x.png\" class=\"cert-20 me-2\" alt=\"Movie Sound Dolby Atmos\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_12A_RGB.svg\" class=\"cert-20\" alt=\"BBFC Cert 12A\">\n    </div><p class=\"text-white opacity-6\"><small>Thriller, Action</small></p>    </div>    </div>\n</div>\n</section></section><section id=\"section_3_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0\">            <div class=\"container my-5\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-0\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-uppercase\">The Amateur</h3>\n\n\n                        <p><img src=\"https://media.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_12A_RGB.svg \" class=\"cert-40 my-4\" alt=\"BBFC Cert $certs\" ></p>\n\n                                                    <h3 class=\" fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Synopsis</h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-5 text-dark\">After his life is turned upside down when his wife is killed in a London terrorist attack, a brilliant but introverted CIA decoder takes matters into his own hands when his supervisors refuse to take action.</p>\n                                                \n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-7 col-md-8\">\n                                \n\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Duration:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">2hr 2mins</p>\n                                \n\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Available Sound Formats:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder sound-formats\">\n                                        Dolby Atmos                                    </p>\n                                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Genre:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Thriller, Action</p>\n                                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Country:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">United States</p>\n                                \n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-5 col-md-4\">\n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Director:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">James Hawes</p>\n                                \n                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-secondary\">Starring:</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Michael Stuhlbarg,<br> Jon Bernthal,<br> Rami Malek,<br> Danny Sapani,<br> Laurence Fishburne,<br> Adrian Martinez,<br> Alice Hewkin,<br> Joseph Millson,<br> Julianne Nicholson,<br> Takehiro Hira,<br> Rachel Brosnahan</p>\n                                                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                        <!-- <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                            </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“Florence Pugh and Andrew Garfield scorch…The pair’s chemistry is off the charts and each set-piece a showstopper in this tragic romance.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Kevin Maher, The Times\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“It’s such a joy to watch two such assured and natural performers allowed the room to exercise both movie star and actor muscles as well as showcase their ease with both comedy and drama.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Benjamin Lee, Guardian\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“The perfect movie for when you want to sit in your feelings and be taken on an unashamedly emotional journey…Garfield and Pugh are as dreamy a team as you’d hope!”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                            Tori Brazier, Metro\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n\n                        <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">\n                        <figure>\n                            <div class=\"d-block mb-4\">\n                                                        </div>\n                            <blockquote class=\"blockquote text-dark\">\n                                <p>“Andrew Garfield and Florence Pugh will break your heart in a London romance of rare honesty.”</p>\n                            </blockquote>\n                            <figcaption class=\"blockquote-footer mt-3\">\n                                Helen O'Hara, Time Out\n                            </figcaption>\n                        </figure> -->\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n 